  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e01-scene-26",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "表と裏の世界  (The Front and Hidden Worlds)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Over drinks at the bar, the protagonist asks the young hustler what he was selling that caused such a fight. He pulls out cassette tapes from his bag and tells him that every human being has two sides: a public surface and a hidden underside. Listen to this philosophy.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "さっきは何を売ったんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よくぞ聞いてくれたよ。これだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "すすきののホテルで録れたシリーズだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "偽物か？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "違うよ。これは正真正銘の本物だぜ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺は人生のすべてを家族にささげてきたんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "気持ちは分かるよ。でもお金だけじゃだめだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "だったら俺だって言いたいことがある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "誰だって人間には表と裏があるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "裏？そんなの隠してるから分からないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "お礼に見せてやろうか？裏の世界を。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "裏の世界か。見てみよう。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "さっきは何を売ったんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What was it you sold earlier?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よくぞ聞いてくれたよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Glad you asked!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "偽物か？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is it a fake?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これは正真正銘の本物だぜ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the genuine, real deal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺は人生のすべてを家族にささげてきたんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have devoted my entire life to my family.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "気持ちは分かるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I get how you feel.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "だったら俺だって言いたいことがある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, I have things I want to say too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "誰だって人間には表と裏があるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every single person has a public front and a hidden side.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "裏？そんなの隠してるから分からないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A hidden side? People hide that, so how could anyone know?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "お礼に見せてやろうか？裏の世界を。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By way of thanks, shall I show it to you? The hidden world.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
